% ---------------------------------------------------------------- options
% Default = PRINT edition: \stepanim prints a storyboard (works in every viewer and on paper).
% [interactive] = SCREEN edition: \stepanim becomes an animation (Acrobat/Okular/Foxit) AND the
%                 storyboard is still printed under it, so viewers that cannot play it lose nothing.
% [phone]       = single-column small page (105 x 187 mm, 10.5 pt) for reading on a phone; tables and
%                 TikZ pictures are shrunk to \linewidth, storyboards become one frame per row.
% [cheatsheet]  = dense landscape layout.
% (build.py makes <Subj>_<Scope>_Guide.pdf, _Guide_Interactive.pdf, _Guide_Phone.pdf, _Cheatsheet.pdf)
